sudden, profound silence. Elias turned to Thomas, a grin spreading across his face. \"Well,\" he said, raising his glass. \"To us. To the untouchables.\" Thomas raised his own glass, the crystal catching the light. \"To the untouchables,\" he echoed, his smile faint, barely there."
}

