ine of text from an unknown source: 'It’s awake.' The words sent a chill down his spine, far colder than the air conditioning. He looked up, towards the server room, and for a second, he thought he heard a whisper, a sound that wasn’t quite sound, but a vibration in the bones of the building itself."
